# Goobers in-repo instance: this directory (goobers/) IS the instance root.
#
# TRACKED (definitions-as-code + docs):
#   config/            — manifest.yaml + gaggles/**; the daemon reads defs
#                        straight from here (WorkflowSource nil default)
#   instance.yaml.example, README.md, .gitignore
#
# IGNORED (runtime state the daemon materializes on `goobers up goobers`):
#   everything below. Patterns are anchored to this dir's root so they can
#   NEVER shadow config/ or the tracked example/README.

# Instance-root runtime files
/instance.yaml
/telemetry.db
/telemetry.db-shm
/telemetry.db-wal

# Runtime directories: scheduler ledger + top-level runs/workcopies aliases
# (single-gaggle instances create these as symlinks — Windows needs Dev Mode)
/runs/
/workcopies/
/scheduler/

# Per-gaggle runtime state written under the materialized config tree, if any
config/gaggles/*/runs/
config/gaggles/*/workcopies/
config/gaggles/*/.runs.*
